<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/horse-safari.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Off the beaten path · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Horseback Safari in Nanyuki</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>3 days · 2 nights</b></span>
        <span>Nanyuki · Laikipia</span>
        <span>All riding abilities</span>
        <span>from <b>$1,750</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Horseback%20Safari%20in%20Nanyuki" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off-beat escapes</a> / Horseback Safari in Nanyuki</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">There's no closer way to the wild than from the saddle. On the rolling Laikipia plains around Nanyuki you ride right alongside zebra, giraffe and gazelle — no engine, no fences — with Mount Kenya rising snow-tipped on the horizon.</p>
        <p>A horse-lover's weekend (and a wonderful first ride for novices), with sure-footed, well-schooled horses, expert guides and a private conservancy all to yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your escape</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To Nanyuki &amp; the saddle</h3><p>Fly or drive up to Laikipia, crossing the equator on the way. Meet your horse and guide for a gentle afternoon ride to find your seat, then sundowners over the plains.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Laikipia riding lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>A full day in the saddle</h3><p>A longer ride across the conservancy, cantering beside plains game and pausing for a bush picnic in the shade. An optional walk with rhino or a sundowner ride to close the day.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Laikipia riding lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Morning ride &amp; home</h3><p>One last dawn ride with the mountain glowing pink, a leisurely breakfast, then the journey home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Transfers (or flights) to Laikipia</li>
          <li>Two nights at a riding lodge</li>
          <li>Guided rides for your ability</li>
          <li>Well-schooled horses &amp; all tack</li>
          <li>All meals &amp; bush picnics</li>
          <li>Conservancy fees</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$1,750 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>resident rates available</strong>. Suitable for novice to experienced riders (we match the horse and pace to you). Lovely year-round; the dry months ride best. Non-riders can game-drive instead.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Into the wild, on horseback.</h2><p>Tell us your riding level and dates and we'll match the perfect horse and lodge.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Horseback%20Safari%20in%20Nanyuki" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More escapes</p><h2 class="section__title">Other off-beat escapes</h2></div>
