        <a class="feat" href="camel-trek-northern.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/camel-trek.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Camel Trek in the North</h3><p>3 days · the Northern Frontier.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="northern-kenya-desert.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-samburu.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Northern Kenya Desert Safari</h3><p>4 days · Turkana &amp; Chalbi.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="index.html#experiences"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All quick escapes</h3><p>Browse every off-beat experience.</p></div></a>
